  <TM_PoisonTrap.label>毒药陷阱</TM_PoisonTrap.label>
  <!--原中文: '一个由刺和细绳组成的陷阱， 它可以完美地与地形贴合从而骗过未经训练的眼睛， 但是它的气味会给动物们一个明显的警告. 当一个受害者触发陷阱，德鲁伊之毒的粒子将会排放到空气中. 这种毒同时用来伤害和使受害者失去行动能力。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'A trap created from sticks and twine, it blends seamlessly with the terrain to the untrained eye, but is scented to be an unmistakable warning to animals. Particles of druidic poison are discharged into the air when a victim triggers the trap. The poison is toxic and serves to both injure and disable the victim.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: A trap created from sticks and twine, it blends seamlessly with the terrain to the untrained eye, but is scented to be an unmistakable warning to animals. Particles of druidic poison are discharged into the air when a victim triggers the trap. The poison is toxic and serves to both injure and disable the victim.-->
  <TM_PoisonTrap.description>一个由刺和细绳组成的陷阱， 它可以完美地与地形贴合从而骗过未经训练的眼睛， 但是它的气味会给动物们一个明显的警告. 当一个受害者触发陷阱，德鲁伊之毒的粒子将会排放到空气中. 这种毒同时用来伤害和使受害者失去行动能力。</TM_PoisonTrap.description>
