  <!--原中文: '60毫米迫击炮是一种个人可运输和部署的间接火力系统。 由于系统的重量，外壳通常被分散运输。 该系统用于间接射击，只有业余爱好者尝试使用该系统进行直接射击，因为它既不准确，又会暴露迫击炮手。

由于迫击炮管和爆炸弹的密封能力，与固定系统相比，该系统的射程和火力受到限制。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: '60mm Mortar is a personally transportable and deployable indirect fire system. Due to the weight of the system, the shells are typically distributed for transport. The system is intended for indirect fire and only amateurs attempt to use the system for direct lay as it is both inaccurate and exposes the mortar-man. 
	
	The range and firepower of the system are limited compared to stationary systems due the containment capacity of the mortar tube and the blast cartridge.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: 60mm Mortar is a personally transportable and deployable indirect fire system. Due to the weight of the system, the shells are typically distributed for transport. The system is intended for indirect fire and only amateurs attempt to use the system for direct lay as it is both inaccurate and exposes the mortar-man. 
	
	The range and firepower of the system are limited compared to stationary systems due the containment capacity of the mortar tube and the blast cartridge.-->
  <TM_60mmMortar_Base.description>60毫米迫击炮是一种个人可运输和部署的间接火力系统。 由于系统的重量，外壳通常被分散运输。 该系统用于间接射击，只有业余爱好者尝试使用该系统进行直接射击，因为它既不准确，又会暴露迫击炮手。

由于迫击炮管和爆炸弹的密封能力，与固定系统相比，该系统的射程和火力受到限制。</TM_60mmMortar_Base.description>
